From 2814bf6cb905d46e6603a6b77647d351749d848f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 23:46:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 073/184] net: omci: add Generic Netlink transport and Airoha
 backend

Add a generic OMCI transport under net/omci. The core owns the
userspace endpoint, queues received PDUs, exposes state and statistics,
and validates baseline and extended messages before transmission.

Connect the Airoha EN7523 GPON MAC to the core through the QDMA OAM
descriptor path. Remove the placeholder OMCI netdevice, which treated
raw OMCI PDUs as Ethernet frames and discarded every transmitted skb.

Keep the G.988 managed-entity database and state machine in userspace.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
